<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.9.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 276,883 shares of Polish construction firm Mostostal Krakow SA at 3.9 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Mostostal Krakow, which chose not to conduct an initial public offering, starts trade on the Warsaw exchange's main market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
